+/**
+ * The canonical model of "Copy Markdown" v2.2 (spec sections 2, 3, 7 and 8). A Markdown source (`canonMd`) and the HTML a
+ * message carries (`canonHtml`) are both reduced to one tree, so that "this body is the Markdown source of that HTML" is
+ * the deep equality of two trees (`canonEqual`). Only the raw strings of an event go in: no setting, no renderer of the
+ * copying client, no locale. It is meant to be ported rule by rule (commonmark.js, pulldown-cmark or comrak with no
+ * extensions on the Markdown side; the HTML side has no parser to port, it is the tokenizer and tree builder below), so
+ * every rule is spelled out.
