+ * digits upper cased, and is decoded only when it encodes an unreserved character (`A-Z a-z 0-9 - . _ ~`). A reserved
+ * character is never decoded, a `%` that does not start `%XX` stays as it is, a percent run that is not UTF-8 is kept.
